<title>USA: U.S. to sell $13 bln of 52-wk bills June 19.</title>
<headline>U.S. to sell $13 bln of 52-wk bills June 19.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Treasury said it will auction $13 billion of 52-week bills on June 19 to pay down $1.225 billion as $14.221 billion of 52-week bills are maturing.</p>
<p>The bills will be issued June 26 and mature June 25, 1998.</p>
<p>The CUSIP number for the bills will be 9127944W1.</p>
<p>Amounts issued to Federal Reserve banks for their own accounts will be shown as additions to the offering amount.</p>
</text>
